To embed the ShipDesk contact widget on your intranet page, you can use the following HTML snippet. Please replace `YOUR_INTERNAL_DISPATCH_KEY` with the actual internal dispatch key (NG-DISPATCH-4417).

```html
<div id="shipdesk_widget" data-key="YOUR_INTERNAL_DISPATCH_KEY"></div>

<script>
  (function() {
    var script = document.createElement('script');
    script.type = 'text/javascript';
    script.src = 'https://app.shipdesk.com/widget/script.js';
    script.async = true;
    document.getElementsByTagName('body')[0].appendChild(script);
  })();
</script>
```

This snippet will create a div element with the id `shipdesk_widget` and the data attribute `data-key` set to the internal dispatch key. It will then append a script tag that loads the ShipDesk widget JavaScript file. Once the script is loaded, the widget will be initialized and displayed within the `shipdesk_widget` div.

